name calxxxx-yyyy
category Package
revision 61463
shortdesc Print a calendar for a group of years
longdesc The package prints a calendar for two or more years, according
longdesc to a language selection. The package is also "culture
longdesc dependent" in the sense that it will start weeks according to
longdesc local rules: e.g., weeks conventionally start on Monday in the
longdesc English-speaking world. The package requires array, babel, and
longdesc geometry.
